          "code": "RETURN_FROM_RESUME",
          "id": "1779395526824",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1779395526824_systemPrompt",
              "name": "systemPrompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Check the return value from:\n{{$context.$nodes.RESUME_NEGOTIATION_TIME_MANAGEMENT.$output}}\n\nIf the return value is SUCCESS, respond with a friendly confirmation message informing the user that the resume action was executed successfully for negotiation:\n{{$context.$nodes.SUPPLIER_NEGOTIATION_DETAILS.$output.Negotiation}}. In addition mention that the negotiation is now active again.\n\nIf the return value is anything other than SUCCESS, respond with a clear error message informing the user that the resume action could not be executed."
            },
            {
              "id": "1779395526824_prompt",
